 Today's newsletter is 850 words, a 3-minute read. 

 📉 The dashboard: The S&amp;P 500 closed down 0.3%.

 Visions of a rate hike were dancing in investors' heads today (more on that below 👇), but stocks still posted a positive week ( cough -Nvidia- cough ). Zoom out: The S&amp;P closed up 0.5% for the week 📈, and is up 12.7% for the year 📈. 🥶 Today's stock spotlight: PayPal (-12.7%), on reports Advent International and Stripe abandoned their pursuit of the company.

 
 
